Chapter 14 — Communication System

14.1 Radio Frequency Links

AMLEV carries a software‑defined radio (SDR) covering UHF (390–450 MHz), X‑band (8.4 GHz uplink, 7.2 GHz downlink), and Ka‑band (26 GHz). Link budgets for a lunar direct‑to‑Earth (DTE) scenario from the south pole, assuming a 34 m DSN receiver, are:

